e + N2 -> N_Z2plus + N + 3e (atomic N^2+). Cross section: Song et al., J. Phys. Chem. Ref. Data 52, 023104 (2023), Table 10 sigma(N++) (total N++ yield; triple events' extra N+ not added), linear ramp from 0 at E_th = 53.885 eV to the 70 eV point; held above 1000 eV (tail share 0.000 % at 45 eV, 0.026 % at 150 eV, 0.946 % at 255 eV). Header 53.885 eV = appearance energy. Maxwellian-integrated by abep_sim/rate_tables.py (scripts/build_n2_to_n_z2plus_table.py). Evidence level 4. Reaction set abep-n2n-0.6.
